hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19218","Hasan ibn Musa narrated to us, Ibn Lahiah narrated to us, Bakr ibn Sawadah narrated to us from Ubayd Allah ibn Aslam, freedman of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) used to say to Jafar ibn Abi Talib: You resemble me in appearance and character."
